  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ttukbaegi earthenware pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Stir in the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes and vegetable broth, and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the shredded stracciatella cheese until melted and smooth.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro."
